### health
$ curl http://127.0.0.1:8090/actuator/health
HTTP 200
{
    "status": "UP",
    "groups": [
        "liveness",
        "readiness"
    ]
}

### sign-on - user id required
$ curl -X POST -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"userId":"","password":"PASSWORD"} http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/signon
HTTP 400
{
    "status": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Please enter User ID ...",
    "fieldFlags": {
        "userId": "BLANK"
    }
}

### sign-on - password required
$ curl -X POST -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"userId":"ADMIN001","password":""} http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/signon
HTTP 400
{
    "status": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Please enter Password ...",
    "fieldFlags": {
        "password": "BLANK"
    }
}

### sign-on - unknown user
$ curl -X POST -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"userId":"NOSUCH","password":"PASSWORD"} http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/signon
